    Debounce wrapper.

    Args:
        wait (float): Delay in seconds before invoking the wrapped function.
        leading (bool): If True, invoke immediately on first call. Default False.
        max_wait (float|None): Maximum time between calls relative to `wait`.
                               When provided, ensures that after a series of calls
                               spaced more than `max_wait` apart, only the last call
                               triggers execution.

    Returns:
        Callable: A function identical in signature to the wrapped one but debounced.
    """
