| **Advance minute/hour/day‑of‑month/month** to the next value that is greater than “now”. If none exists in the current month, jump forward to the first valid day of the next month. |
| **Validate dow**: walk from today’s date until a weekday matches any allowed `dow` values (0=Sun … 6=Sat). |
